// file: vvaharness/backends/llm/deepagents.py
// via: deepagents -- LangGraph harness route: options assembly, transient retry ladder, refusal/auth/proxy classification.
// max_turns here is a recursion limit, not a hard turn cap as on sdk/cli/openai. Deliberately NOT registered in the registry:
// stages branch on the resolved via themselves. INVARIANT 1: cwd is the HOST repo root; the agent may emit a virtual absolute
// path that scope.resolve_inventory_path must resolve at every model-path entry point. INVARIANT 2: token phase bucketing is
// correct only because callers block (runSync waits), so concurrent calls across DIFFERENT phases would cross-contaminate.

